# Generate all the possible multipole expansion for magnetic structures at R point
crystod --spin-basis --poscar 221_PPOSCAR_AlNi3 --element Ni --qpoint 0.5 0.5 0.5

Space group: Pm-3m (#221)
Magnetic sites: Ni x 3
  Ni1: [0.5, 0.5, 0.0]
  Ni2: [0.5, 0.0, 0.5]
  Ni3: [0.0, 0.5, 0.5]

Selected q-point: R = [0.5, 0.5, 0.5]

Spin (axial-vector) representation on Ni sites: 9 dimensions
Decomposition: R2+(1) + R3+(2) + R4+(3) + R5+(3)

Symmetry-adapted spin bases:
  R2+(1): dim 1 [AFM (q != 0)]
  R3+(2): dim 2 [AFM (q != 0)]
  R4+(3): dim 3 [AFM (q != 0)]
  R5+(3): dim 3 [AFM (q != 0)]

Magnetic (commensurate) supercell: 2x2x2

